## Reviewer points not applied

- a#4 “do not display the Hangul path” — the url is source frontmatter. R16 says leave it. No Khmer page label was rewritten into Hangul.
- a#25 / b#21 collect blog lines into new ## paragraphs. Same layout as the English source; block count and heading levels are locked.
- a#29 reformatting TWD 1.57M. The figure is a preserved substring.
- a#30 adding 2023. ROC year 112 is now labeled as a Republic of China year; the case number is unchanged.
- b#1 suggested «ចោទប្រកាន់បាន». ACCEPTED requires «ត្រូវចោទប្រកាន់».
- b#4 suggested «ស្ថាប័នតុលាការ». ACCEPTED requires សភាតុលាការ or តុលាការកំពូល. Used សភាតុលាការ. យួន is gone.
- b#9 suggested «រាជរដ្ឋាភិបាល». English is “the government”; Taiwan is not a monarchy. Used រដ្ឋាភិបាល. Later in the same paragraph the single government or corporate shareholder stays រដ្ឋាភិបាល.
- b#16 “also change ក្រុមហ៊ុនគោលដៅ”. ACCEPTED keeps គោលដៅ for an acquisition target. Scope and the administrative time benchmark were reworded; the target company was not.
- a#24 full nav label «សេចក្ដីបដិសេធទំនួលខុសត្រូវ» was not put in the menu. Nav is «សេចក្ដីបដិសេធ»; the disclaimer eyebrow uses the full phrase.
- ឧបត្ថម្ភបន្ទាប់ពីលែងលះ (贍養費), ការបាត់ផលឧបត្ថម្ភ (扶養利益損失), and ការស្នាក់នៅតាមអ្នកឧបត្ថម្ភ (依親居留) are maintenance, lost support, and dependent residence, not the German Unterstützung calque.
- «សាលដីកាជាដាច់ខាត» is a final judgment, not 差額.
- «ប្រយោជន៍ខ្ពស់បំផុតរបស់កូន» and statutory «អតិបរមា» caps were left. They are not firm advertising.
